BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Secret Agent
DTSTART:20260101T200000Z
DTEND:20260101T225500Z
DTSTAMP:20260101T200000Z
UID:KmZZeYauF9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 159 mins (2h39m)\n\nKleber Mendonça Filho (Bacurau)
  returns with a thrillingly unpredictable\, shape-shifting epic set in his
  hometown of Recife during the late 1970s\, starring a magnetic Wagner Mou
 ra as a man on the run from his past.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-th
 eaters/the-secret-agent\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Other Choice
DTSTART:20260101T234000Z
DTEND:20260102T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20260101T234000Z
UID:F7cNbLhD13
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 139 mins (2h19m)\n\nIn his diabolical new thriller\,
  Park Chan-wook crafts a dark fable about the cutthroat nature of contempo
 rary work culture\, starring Lee Byung Hun as a husband and father who tak
 es violent action after being laid off.  From January 1 to 4\, all 7pm sh
 owtimes will be presented in 35mm. Free exclusive translucent mini posters
  available at these screenings while supplies last.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/cinema/in-theaters/no-other-choice\n\nEstimated start: 15:55
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
